# Run artifacts. Globs, not exact names: these hold plaintext order data — side, size, limit
# price, the taker's XRPL address — which is the one thing the desk promises never leaves the
# enclave. A per-name list silently stops covering the moment a script writes a new tag
# (competing-makers.mjs writes quote-<maker>.json), so match the shape instead.
rfq-*.json
quote-*.json
match*.json
